		(at 13.97 322.58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left))
		(uuid "64b6e14d-960e-42b8-a184-f5c39b709aef")
	)
	(text "VBUS >= 30.2 V: LM5013 -> +5V_BUCK -> PG_5V\n  -> TPS2116 selects the buck (else VUSB)\n+5V -> 3V3 -> PG_3V3 -> 1V1 (~1 ms), 2V5 (~5 ms)\nVBUS >= 29.8 V: Fly-Buck -> +-15 V (14 ms)\n  -> +5V_A; +15V >= 7.1 V enables 3V3_Q\nVDRV off until VDRV_EN (firmware, after\n  FPGA DONE, PD_PG_N low, POE_LOSS_N high)\nUSB only: +5V, 3V3, 1V1, 2V5, 3V3_A\n\nHold-up >= 34 ms after the VBUS < 40 V\ntrip at 60 W on 6 mF (UVLO-off <= 30.2 V)\n\nR-80: 0R / bridged-jumper link at every\nconverter input; test point on every rail;\nSW-node pads with GND springs on io sheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 344.424 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "91cc3954-e640-42b1-946c-16bd95675d62")
	)
